    "title": "These Small-Town Bakeries In Illinois Are Summer Favorites - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lucas Hardin ,\n9 hours ago What’s better on a summer day than grabbing a fresh pastry or a slice of pie from a local bakery?. In Illinois, small-town bakeries are the kind of places people look forward to visiting once the warm weather rolls in. They’re not flashy or overly polished, but that’s exactly what makes them special; each one has its own charm and flavors that keep locals and travelers coming back. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
